{'symbol': 'GE', 'date': '2022-07-18 08:30:00', 'title': 'GE UNVEILS BRAND NAMES FOR THREE PLANNED FUTURE PUBLIC COMPANIES', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--GE (NYSE:GE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE BRAND NAMES OF THE FUTURE COMPANIES IT WILL CREATE THROUGH ITS PLANNED SEPARATION INTO THREE INDUSTRY-LEADING, GLOBAL, INVESTMENT-GRADE PUBLIC COMPANIES FOCUSED ON THE GROWTH SECTORS OF HEALTHCARE, ENERGY, AND AVIATION. GE HEALTHCARE WILL BE THE NAME OF GE'S HEALTHCARE BUSINESS. GE'S EXISTING ENERGY PORTFOLIO OF BUSINESSES, INCLUDING RENEWABLE ENERGY, POWER, DIGITAL, AND ENERGY FINANCIAL SERVICES, WILL SIT TOGETHER UNDER THE BRAND NAME G"}